# Scope: intention-menu-builder plugin only

- **Only modify files under this repository root** (`user/plugins/intention-menu-builder/`).
- Do **not** edit `user/config/`, `user/pages/`, themes, other plugins, `system/`, `vendor/`, or parent Grav site `.cursor/`.
- If plugin enablement or site config is needed, **describe steps for the user**; do not apply them from this workspace.

Examples:

```
✅ intention-menu-builder.php
✅ admin-next/pages/intention-menu-builder.js
✅ blueprints.yaml
✅ classes/MenuRepository.php

❌ user/config/plugins/intention-menu-builder.yaml
❌ user/data/intention-menu-builder/header.yaml
❌ user/themes/intention-base/
❌ parent Grav .cursor/notes/changelog.md
```
